ut everything i'm talking  100 accurate on everything that was  going to happen in the movie  well since then he started a new account  an account that some people were kind of  skeptical about whether or not it was  really him  however back in december he tweeted in  order to not arouse any suspicions and  to blend into the community  wanda and vision will pretend to be  stage magicians known as glamor  and illusion now this was tweeted in  december and as we found out last friday  this ended up being true  which gives us reason to believe that  this account is legitimate  considering how he leaked something that  ended up being true months in advance  and like i said this twitter account has  reported that storm is going to be  making an mcu appearance in thor love  and thunder  back in march of 2020 he said a version  of thor core  will make its way into the upcoming thor  iv  notable members of the team include beta  ray bill  dargo tor thunder strike simon walterson  slash throg  groot gamora sif angela  and storm now the thor core was a part  of the avengers  secret wars battle world storyline a  storyline that i truly believe  marvel studios is setting up right now  in the mcu and will eventually  lead up to in about seven to ten years  but the thor core  was made up of multiple men and women  across battle world and served as  god emperor doom's police force in order  to become a member of the thor corps  one must be worthy to wield the power of  mjolnir during a ceremony held in one of  the halls of  doomguard the thor corp space of  operation now eventually jane foster's  thor from a different universe would  realize that god emperor doom was  actually the villain and she would get  the thor core to turn  on doom and then ultimately they would  fight with the good guys  now of course this actual storyline is  not going to be a huge part of thor love  and thunder because  secret wars and battle world are  probably years away  but of course they're going to 